      "summary": "This spell can only be used at the start of any given round",
      "value": "<p>This spell can only be used at the start of any given round. The caster of this spell can steal the target’s initiative. If the spell is successful, the caster and the creature that he targets, switch initiatives. This effect does not grant any extra actions for the given round and does not replenish the swift action of the caster.</p>"
